test.yaml:6:14: failure of "curl" is hidden in the pipeline "curl -fsSL https://example.com/install.sh | sh" because the default shell runs "bash -e {0}" without pipefail. add "set -o pipefail" before the pipeline or use "shell: bash", which runs with pipefail [pipeline-without-pipefail]
